            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-9306, Small Cabinet Knob with Tip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Solid Brass Cabinet Knob with Tip has a 1 inch diameter and is great for smaller applications like furniture drawers. It is available in 5 finishes including satin nickel and oil rubbed bronze. Easy to install with the included hardware, this small cabinet knob will add a quiet elegance to any traditional home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-9306 Solid Round Knob with Tip:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
